Z||000000||Ferrari_cdn||08-20-2001||04:06 PM||||Going home at about 2:30 I saw a brownish GT parked on Portage just outside Magic Land arcade centre near U of W.  Don't know the year, I dont know the differences yet.  Was that one of you people?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Nice car.  Making me want mine to arrive more sooner.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||6
Z||000001||baldlobo||08-20-2001||06:44 PM||||I dought it was me an mach in his car, but we were crusing around, was it notchback or fastback style rear clip, if it was a notchback it might have been mach going home, after dropping me off.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Ferrari_cdn||08-20-2001||08:16 PM||||i really want to know the difference, but i dont know what a fastback or a notchback is.<P>sorry.||||reg||11
Z||000003||Mach10||08-21-2001||04:15 PM||||Notchback is the more "Traditional" look. The rear-end angles sharply down to the decklid, and has solid sail panels. The Notchback curves gently down to pretty much the end of the decklid, and has clear "windows."<P>I didn't see the car, personally, but we were up and down Portage until probably around 2am... You should come out with us. I can only take one person though. BaldLobo's car is still in the works, in need of some repair, and yours is "In Transit" <BR>Usually we just hang around Burger Factory and talk 'n stuff.<P>Oh, I've been meaning to ask. Why did you buy yours in BC? There are usually a couple of decent ones up for grabs locally... Did you get an awesome deal? Family? What gives to justify the shipping expense?||||reg||7
Z||000004||Ferrari_cdn||08-22-2001||01:40 AM||||Yeah I would love us to get together someday and get a ride in it.  And why just 1 passenger?<P>Oh I forgot Fieros are 2 seaters.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>Its from BC because of family, my brother in law's uncle has one and is only 57,000 km, and just $1,500 so I thought it was a good deal.  I didn't know a thing about Fieros but now I'm learning more.  Now I know there's a lot of them selling around.  I just thought its good to get this because the engine was rebuilt.  So I felt it means he might have fixed it better with better parts or things like that.<P>Send me your email at ferrari@mb.sympatico.ca so we can chat.<P>I've always wanted to ride in a Fiero so I can get to know what it feels like.<P>Once I get it you can be sure to see it on Portage often because I drive on it everyday.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
